  "title": "Quick Smoky Uruguayan Baby Plum Tomato Skewers",
  "description": "A smoky and crispy Uruguayan dish featuring baby plum tomatoes, perfect for a midnight craving. This low-fat-friendly recipe is cooked to perfection on a robata-grill.",
