  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata-grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Thread the halved baby plum tomatoes onto skewers.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together olive oil, smoked paprika, garlic powder, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the mixture onto the tomatoes.",
    "Grill the skewers for 5 minutes per side, or until the tomatoes are tender and lightly charred.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
